<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,860 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 134.76 pence a kilo against 140.79 last week and 112.80 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 66,219 pkgs sold so far this year is 124.97 pence against 113.10 pence for the 76,763 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
